# LongShot agent rules

- Read `docs/AIRULES.md`, `docs/SPRINTS.md`, and `docs/STATUS.md` before large changes.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, DB dumps).
- Keep alert ingest authenticated (`X-API-Key` or JWT).
- Prefer Docker Compose for local stack; do not reintroduce VirtualBox as the primary path.
- No AI-slop UI (purple glow, emoji clutter, pointless card grids).
- Stay within the current sprint scope; update docs when behavior changes.
- Prefer small diffs; avoid unrelated refactors.
